Hi,

 

The way GADGET deals with this is thorough text aggregation files that translate names to length bins in the computations. Something like:

 

# nam   low      up

Len1     1          5

Len2     5          12

Len3     12        20

Len4     20        30

...

 

If we do not like to have many extra files, the use of labels with the boundaries (Len1_5, Len5_12, Len12_20, etc) may also be a good option.

 

Santi

 

 

