Yes, we (Iago and me) were discussing that issue. We shouldn't accept 
sparse data, the methods will have to check each bin and deal with the 
missing observations. If we force all lengths to be present we may loose 
a bit on space but the methods wont need to check the length of the bins 
and workout what is going on.

